<title>GREECE: REUTERS' KOMBOPOULOS GOES TO NATWEST, ATHENS.</title>
<headline>REUTERS' KOMBOPOULOS GOES TO NATWEST, ATHENS.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Reuters' Adrianos Kombopoulos, a risk management and transaction products specialist, is going to National Westminster Bank, Athens, market sources said.</p>
<p>He will join the bank's treasury sales team in mid-February. --Dimitris Kontogiannis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
